# Written with AI assistance (Claude Code)
# LF in the repo and in working copies (later lines override earlier ones).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.NEF binary
# Data files are byte-exact: their sha256 is recorded in provenance, and the validators and
# tests read them byte for byte. Never convert their line endings on any machine (Windows
# checkouts with autocrlf turned the mocks into CRLF and broke two contract tests).
data/** -text
